  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diversifying Rural Development Skills and Creating Value-added Agricultural Products</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FNN plans to increase income from crops, livestock and fisheries in 15 communities in the municipalities of Batallas and Pucarani, on the altiplano, by improving farming skills, product quality and marketing to niche outlets in the city of La Paz. The grantee&apos;s innovative institutional arrangement should benefit 250 farmers.</narrative>
  </description>
